### 3.2 Migration

**Lokasi:** `database/migrations/YYYY_MM_DD_HHMMSS_create_{module_table}.php`

**Aturan Umum Migration:**

| Aspek | Aturan |
|-------|--------|
| **Naming Pattern** | `create_{plural_table_name}_table.php` |
| **Timestamp** | Gunakan tanggal yang terurut, bisa di masa depan (e.g. 2026_07_22) |
| **Komentar** | `// KUSTOM erickalvino-XX: deskripsi` |
| **Index** | Tambahkan index untuk foreign key dan kolom yang sering di-query |
| **Foreign Keys** | Gunakan constrained() -> cascadeOnDelete() |
| **Soft Deletes** | Tambahkan `softDeletes()` jika perlu |
| **Pivot / Polymorphic** | Child table menggunakan morphs() untuk polymorphic |

**Struktur Migration Parent:**

```php
Schema::create('asset_mutations', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->id();
    $table->string('document_number')->unique();
    $table->foreignId('origin_location_id')->constrained('locations');
    $table->foreignId('destination_location_id')->constrained('locations');
    $table->string('status')->default('draft');
    $table->text('notes')->nullable();
    $table->timestamps();
    $table->softDeletes();

    $table->index('status');
    $table->index('document_number');
});
```

**Struktur Migration Child (Multi-Item):**

```php
Schema::create('asset_items', function (Blueprint $table) {
    $table->id();
    // Polymorphic parent
    $table->morphs('itemable');
    // Field spesifik
    $table->foreignId('asset_id')->constrained('assets');
    $table->string('new_asset_tag');
    $table->string('condition_before')->nullable();
    $table->string('condition_after')->nullable();
    $table->text('notes')->nullable();
    $table->timestamps();
    $table->softDeletes();

    $table->unique('new_asset_tag');
    $table->index(['itemable_id', 'itemable_type']);
});
```

