### 3.3 Policy

**Lokasi:** `app/Policies/{Module}Policy.php`

**Aturan Umum Policy:**

| Aspek | Aturan |
|-------|--------|
| **Nama Class** | `{Module}Policy` (StudlyCase, singular) |
| **Method standar** | `view()`, `create()`, `update()`, `delete()` |
| **Method kustom** | Tambahkan method sesuai aksi spesifik modul, misal: `ship()`, `receive()`, `reject()`, `complete()`, `cancel()` |
| **Superuser bypass** | `return true;` jika user isSuperUser di method tertentu atau via `Gate::before` |
| **Komentar** | `// KUSTOM erickalvino-XX: deskripsi` |

**Pola Policy:**

```php
class AssetMutationPolicy
{
    public function view(User $user): bool
    {
        return $user->hasAccess('assetmutations.view');
    }

    public function create(User $user): bool
    {
        return $user->hasAccess('assetmutations.create');
    }

    public function update(User $user, AssetMutation $assetMutation): bool
    {
        return $user->hasAccess('assetmutations.edit')
            && $assetMutation->status === 'draft'; // hanya draft bisa diedit
    }

    public function delete(User $user, AssetMutation $assetMutation): bool { ... }

    // Aksi kustom
    public function ship(User $user, AssetMutation $assetMutation): bool { ... }
    public function receive(User $user, AssetMutation $assetMutation): bool { ... }
    public function reject(User $user, AssetMutation $assetMutation): bool { ... }
}
```

