**Lokasi:** `app/Http/Requests/{Action}StoreRequest.php`

**Aturan Umum Form Request:**

| Aspek | Aturan |
|-------|--------|
| **Parent Class** | Extends `Illuminate\Foundation\Http\FormRequest` |
