**Pola Bulk Controller:**

```php
class BulkAssetMutationsController extends Controller
{
    public function destroy(Request $request): RedirectResponse
    {
        if ($request->has('ids')) {
            foreach ($request->input('ids') as $id) {
                $mutation = AssetMutation::find($id);
                if ($mutation) {
                    $this->authorize('delete', $mutation);
                    $mutation->delete();
                }
            }
        }
        return redirect()->back()
            ->with('success', trans('general.bulk_delete_success'));
    }
}
```

