### 3.10 Blade Views

**Lokasi:** `resources/views/{module}/` dan `resources/views/blade/table/{module}.blade.php`

#### Struktur Direktori View:

```
resources/views/{module}/
├── index.blade.php      → Halaman daftar (menggunakan bootstrap-table)
├── edit.blade.php       → Halaman create/edit (form)
├── show.blade.php       → Halaman detail
resources/views/blade/table/
├── {module}.blade.php   → Partial tabel untuk index (opsional, bisa inline di index)
```

#### Aturan Umum Views:

| Aspek | Aturan |
|-------|--------|
| **Extends** | `@extends('layouts/default')` |
| **Section title** | `@section('title')` — gunakan trans() |
| **Penerjemahan** | SEMUA teks menggunakan `{{ trans('general.key') }}` |
| **CSRF** | Semua form POST/PUT/DELETE wajib `@csrf` |
| **Method spoofing** | Update: `@method('PUT')` |
| **Bootstrap Table** | Gunakan data-side-pagination="server", data-url ke route API |
| **Authorization di view** | Gunakan `@can('module.action', $item)` untuk conditional buttons |
| **Komentar** | `{{-- KUSTOM erickalvino-XX: deskripsi --}}` |

