## 4. Standar Integrasi Global

### 4.1 Routes (web.php)

**Lokasi:** `routes/web.php`

**Aturan Umum Route Web:**

| Aspek | Aturan |
|-------|--------|
| **Group middleware** | `Route::group(['middleware' => ['auth']], function () { ... })` |
| **Resource route** | `Route::resource('{slug}', Controller::class, [...])->names('{module}');` |
| **Action routes** | `Route::post('{slug}/{id}/{action}', [Controller::class, '{action}'])->name('{module}.{action}');` |
| **Bulk route** | `Route::post('{slug}/bulk/delete', [BulkController::class, 'destroy'])->name('{module}.bulk.delete');` |
| **Parameter name** | `'parameters' => ['{slug}' => '{paramName}']` |
| **Komentar** | Blok komentar di atas grup route: `/* KUSTOM erickalvino-XX: deskripsi */` |

**Pola Route Web:**

```php
